DELETE /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/access/apps/{app_id}
Deletes an application from Access.
Required: app_id (path); account_id (path)

GET /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/access/apps/{app_id}
Fetches information about an Access application.
Required: app_id (path); account_id (path)

PUT /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/access/apps/{app_id}
Updates an Access application.
Required: app_id (path); account_id (path); body (body)

DELETE /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/access/apps/{app_id}/policies/{policy_id}
Deletes an Access policy specific to an application. To delete a reusable policy, use the /accounts/{account_id}/policies/{uid} endpoint.
Required: app_id (path) — The application ID.; policy_id (path) — The policy ID.; account_id (path)

GET /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/access/apps/{app_id}/policies/{policy_id}
Fetches a single Access policy configured for an application. Returns both exclusively owned and reusable policies used by the application.
Required: app_id (path) — The application ID.; policy_id (path) — The policy ID.; account_id (path)

PUT /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/access/apps/{app_id}/policies/{policy_id}
Updates an Access policy specific to an application. To update a reusable policy, use the /accounts/{account_id}/policies/{uid} endpoint.
Required: app_id (path) — The application ID.; policy_id (path) — The policy ID.; account_id (path); body (body)
